	"descriptionMarkdown": "Sorry for no image, Imgur troubles. Its an arrow head shaped ship. idk how else to describe it.\n\nCan comfortably travel between the beginning 4 planets, can travel to Aquilo but may struggle on power, reccomended physical projectile 5+, if not then remove the pointed tip as its stylish but horribly impractical. Holds enough gas for 150000+ km if i did my math right. You can replace a 2 fluid tanks with chemical plants if you prefer more gas production over storage. Enjoy and feel free to edit and reupload.\n\n- Speed Limiter (Current Lock = 150 km/s)\n- Ammo Monitoring\n- Fuel Monitoring\n- Charge Monitoring\n- Low Ammo Engages Emergency brakes.\n- 6 Cargo Bays\n- 6 Grabby arms for more juice!\n- Descriptive panels along the ship, mainly describing decider combinators functions. Made them for my friend but id hope it helps someone else too.\n\nBuilt and tested by a nobody. Made 4-5 round trips from Nauvis to Volcanus with no break before having fuel struggles. It had some upgrades since then though.\n\nThe name: Sagitta (Suh - Jee - Tuh) is a northern constellation shaped like and arrow. I saw it fitting seeing as I'm a Sagittarius and the ships shaped like an arrow. + it sounds cool to say after a while. Broadhead just got thrown in there. Its broad man, idk.",
